OL,3,GNEWSAFossil found on Welsh beach ends
OL,4,A'confusion' over 200-million-year-old
OL,5,Afish teeth
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn amateur fossil hunter's discovery of
OL,8,Fa 200-million-year-old fish jawbone has
OL,9,Fhelped solve two centuries of
OL,10,F"confusion" over the origins of fossils
OL,11,Facross Europe, palaeontologists say.
OL,13,FFossilised teeth found in rock around
OL,14,Fthe Bristol Channel, along with other
OL,15,Fexamples around Europe, had previously
OL,16,Fbeen grouped together as one type of
OL,17,Flarge ancient fish called
OL,18,FSevernichthys.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
