OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.,%%**,$-,(,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFossil found on Welsh beach ends
OL,4,A'confusion' over 200-million-year-old
OL,5,Afish teeth
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut the bone found on the Welsh side of
OL,8,Fthe channel by Jonathan Bow turned out
OL,9,Fto be the first found there to belong
OL,10,Fto a different type.
OL,12,FIt has helped experts discover that
OL,13,Ffossils in museums across the continent
OL,14,Fhad been wrongly grouped and were
OL,15,Factually made up of two different
OL,16,Fspecies - Saurichthys and Birgeria.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
